es to 10 (which is more than 6).\n   - If the Receiver deviates to Anticipate Right, the payoff changes to 2 (which is less than 6).\n   - Therefore, the Server wants to deviate, and the Receiver does not.\n\n4. Consider the cell (Aim Right, Anticipate Right):\n   - Server's payoff is 10, and Receiver's payoff is 2.\n   - If the Server deviates to Aim Left, the payoff changes to 4 (which is less than 10).\n   - If the Receiver deviates to Anticipate Left, the payoff changes to 6 (which is more than 2).\n   - Therefore, the Server does not want to deviate, but the Receiver does.\n\nFrom the analysis, none of the cells represent a situation where neither player would want to deviate. Thus, there is no pure-strategy Nash equilibrium in this game.\n\n**Answer: No.**","reasoning":null,"score":1,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"constraint","constraints":[{"check":"regex","name":"matches no","pattern":"\\b[Nn][Oo]\\b"}]},"breakdown":{"passed":["matches no"],"failed":[],"errored":[]},"timing":{"wall_sec":27.475,"prompt_tokens":173,"generation_tokens":601}},{"item_id":"econ_mixed_server_prob_left","prompt_name":"econ_mixed_server_prob_left","family":"econ-mixed","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"0.67","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"constraint","constraints":[{"check":"regex","name":"equals 0.4","pattern":"(?<![\\d.])0?\\.40*(?!\\d)"}],"nearMisses":[{"slip":"percent-for-decimal","credit":0.5,"pattern":"(?<![\\d.])40(?:\\.0*)?\\s*%"}]},"breakdown":{"passed":[],"failed":["equals 0.4"],"errored":[]},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.568,"prompt_tokens":178,"generation_tokens":4}},{"item_id":"econ_mixed_receiver_prob_left","prompt_name":"econ_mixed_receiver_prob_left","family":"econ-mixed","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"0.5","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"constraint","constraints":[{"check":"regex","name":"equals 0.6","pattern":"(?<![\\d.])0?\\.60*(?!\\d)"}],"nearMisses":[{"slip":"percent-for-decimal","credit":0.5,"pattern":"(?<![\\d.